### 1. Login Automático
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3333/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dev@teste.com",
  "password": "senha123segura"
}

### Guardar o token automaticamente
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 2. Criar Tarefa Automática
POST http://localhost:3333/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "title": "Minha Tarefa Automática",
  "description": "Sem precisar copiar e colar nada!",
  "priority": "HIGH"
}

### 3. Listar Tarefas
GET http://localhost:3333/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
